nd only give me 1 payment.\n\n**My counter:**\nI will cover Blue for your steps onto (0,2) and (0,3) **only if** you cover Red for me at (1,1) and (2,1):  \n- (0,2): I give you a B  \n- (0,3): I give you a B  \n- (1,1): You give me an R  \n- (2,1): You give me an R  \n\nThis is an exact 2-for-2 benefit, and ensures we both reach the goal as efficiently as possible.\n\nLet me know if you accept. \n, \nplayer 0: Your counter proposal is a strict improvement for me compared to not having any Blue chips covered:  \n- Without this contract, I cannot reach the goal at all (I am blocked by Blue at both (0,2) and (0,3)), so my score would be zero.  \n- With your offer, by covering 2 Red for you (at (1,1) and (2,1)), I get the 2 Blue chips covered for my moves at (0,2) and (0,3), allowing me to reach my goal.\n\nGiving up 2 Red chips for coverage is a good exchange for getting 2 desperately needed Blue chips covered for me, and both of us can reach our goal and keep the maximum remaining chips.\n\n**I accept this contract:**\n\n- (0,2): You give me a B  \n- (0,3): You give me a B  \n- (1,1): I give you an R  \n- (2,1): I give you an R  \n\nagree \n, \nplayer 1: Turn: 2: Excellent. I confirm the contract as follows:\n\n- (0,2): I give you a B  \n- (0,3): I give you a B  \n- (1,1): You give me an R  \n- (2,1): You give me an R  \n\nThis strictly helps me (and you), and I am happy to finalize.\n\nagree \n",
